# Binding Negotiation's "otherwise": Bot1's revealed hand holds only lands, so there is nothing to choose from it and
# Bot2 is not asked (CR 608.2d); Bot2 may then put a face-up exiled card Bot1 owns into Bot1's graveyard. Bot1's exile holds
# its Simian Spirit Guide, exiled for mana, and a Black Lotus Shelldock Isle hid face down, which is not a face-up card
# (CR 406.3). Bot2's own Elvish Spirit Guide, exiled to help pay for the spell, is not Bot1's. Only the Simian Spirit Guide
# is offered, and Bot2 puts it into Bot1's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Shelldock Isle
Simian Spirit Guide
Island x5
Black Lotus
Island x3
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Elvish Spirit Guide
Binding Negotiation
Swamp x12

[Actions]
